<section class="legal-section section-pad">
  <div class="legal-wrap">

    <div class="legal-intro">
      <p>
        We take the security of this website seriously. This page explains the
        steps we take to protect your information and keep the website secure.
        While no website can guarantee complete security, we follow good security
        practices to reduce risks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">01</span> Secure Data Storage</h2>

      <p>
        Contact form submissions and visitor information are stored securely in
        MongoDB Atlas.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Only the website owner has access to the database.</li>
        <li>Database credentials are never exposed publicly.</li>
        <li>Sensitive configuration values are stored using environment variables.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">02</span> Protected Communication</h2>

      <p>
        When available, this website uses HTTPS to encrypt communication between
        your browser and the server.
      </p>

      <p>
        Encryption helps protect information while it is being transmitted over
        the internet.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">03</span> Contact Form Security</h2>

      <p>
        Contact form submissions are validated before being processed.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Required fields are checked.</li>
        <li>Input is validated to reduce invalid or malicious submissions.</li>
        <li>Messages are only used to respond to your inquiry.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">04</span> Admin Dashboard Protection</h2>

      <p>
        The admin dashboard is protected and is only accessible to authorized users.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Authentication is required before access is granted.</li>
        <li>Unauthorized visitors cannot access admin features.</li>
        <li>Sensitive data is never displayed publicly.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">05</span> Third-Party Services</h2>

      <p>
        We only use trusted third-party services that help run this website,
        including database, email, fonts, and geolocation services.
      </p>

      <p>
        Each service manages its own security practices and privacy policies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">06</span> What You Can Do</h2>

      <p>
        You can also help keep your information safe by following these simple practices:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Do not share sensitive personal or financial information through the contact form.</li>
        <li>Verify that you are visiting the correct website.</li>
        <li>Report any suspicious activity or security concerns.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">07</span> Reporting a Security Issue</h2>

      <p>
        If you discover a security issue or believe you have found a vulnerability,
        please let us know as soon as possible.
      </p>

      <p>
        We appreciate responsible disclosure and will investigate reported issues promptly.
      </p>

      <p>
        Please include as much detail as possible so the issue can be reproduced and fixed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-block">
      <h2><span class="num">08</span> Contact</h2>

      <p>
        For security-related questions or to report a security issue, contact:
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Vakul Kumar Gaur</strong><br>
        📧 <a href="mailto:gaurvakul25@gmail.com">gaurvakul25@gmail.com</a><br>
        📍 Haridwar, Uttarakhand, India
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

